Incident Response

Reduce potential harm by consistently responding to security incidents quickly and effectively.

Educate your security operations and incident response teams about cloud technologies and how your organization intends to use them. Develop runbooks and create a library of incident response mechanisms. Include key stakeholders to better understand the impact of your choices on the broader organization.

Simulate security events and practice your incident response through table-top exercises and game days. Iterate on the outcome of your simulation to improve the scale of your response posture, reduce time to value, and further reduce risk. Conduct post-incident analyses to learn from security incidents by leveraging a standardized mechanism to identify and resolve root causes.